<title>USA: USX-Delhi acquires Chicago-area contracts.</title>
<headline>USX-Delhi acquires Chicago-area contracts.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USX-Delhi Group said Tuesday Delhi Gas Pipeline Corp has acquired the Chicago-area natural gas marketing contracts of Peterson Associates Inc.</p>
<p>The agreement calls for Delhi to assume total account management for 117 contracts representing 305 office/residential buildings and industrial facilities.</p>
<p>Peterson, a private Dallas-based firm, has been serving Chicago natural gas markets for the past 10 years.</p>
<p>Delhi also said it opened a regional marketing office in the Pittsburgh area that will provide energy services throughout the Ohio Valley Region and in other areas of the Northeast. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
